    "showInTrack": true,
    "iconBanner": null,
    "chapters": [
      {
        "id": 17679,
        "title": "Metodi",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 149910,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Finora gli oggetti che abbiamo creato dalle classi non possono eseguire alcuna azione nel nostro gioco.</p><p>Aggiungendo <strong>metodi</strong> alle classi, potrai creare oggetti di gioco interattivi usando le classi come modelli.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 149911,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungere un metodo in una classe è come creare una normale funzione, tranne per il fatto che non è necessario usare la parola chiave <code>function</code>.</p><p>Questa classe <code>Player</code> non sa ancora fare molto. Aggiungiamole la possibilità di subire danni con un metodo.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"75\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeDamage() {}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>takeDamage</code>, seguito da <code>()</code> e poi <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 149912,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>All'interno delle parentesi graffe, i metodi funzionano come normali funzioni.</p><p>Usiamo <code>console.log</code> per visualizzare un messaggio nella console quando viene chiamata <code>takeDamage()</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"90\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{ \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeDamage() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ouch!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>console.log</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 149913,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Prima di poter usare il metodo <code>takeDamage()</code>, dobbiamo creare un nuovo oggetto dalla classe.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"107\" endIndex=\"112\" /><option startIndex=\"113\" endIndex=\"119\" /><option startIndex=\"120\" endIndex=\"121\" /><option startIndex=\"122\" endIndex=\"125\" /><option startIndex=\"126\" endIndex=\"132\" /><option startIndex=\"132\" endIndex=\"133\" /><option startIndex=\"133\" endIndex=\"138\" /><option startIndex=\"138\" endIndex=\"139\" /><option startIndex=\"139\" endIndex=\"140\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{ \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeDamage() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ouch!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ryu&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>const</code>, seguito da <code>player</code> e poi <code>=</code>, <code>new</code>, <code>Player</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>\"Ryu\"</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 149914,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per usare il metodo <code>takeDamage()</code>, ci serviranno il nome dell'oggetto, un punto, il nome del metodo e le parentesi.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Ryu.takeDamage()\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"player.takeDamage\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"141\" endIndex=\"161\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{ \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeDamage() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ouch!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ryu&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"player.takeDamage();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>player.takeDamage();</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 149915,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>I parametri permettono ai metodi di classe di essere più interattivi, reagendo a ciò che forniamo loro.</p><p>Aggiungi un parametro chiamato <code>amount</code> al metodo <code>takeDamage()</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"77\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeDamage(amount) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ouch!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ryu&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>amount</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 149916,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Con un'istruzione condizionale, gli oggetti che creiamo potranno reagire alla quantità di danni che passiamo a <code>takeDamage()</code>.</p><p>Completa l'aggiunta dell'istruzione che verifica se <code>amount</code> ha un valore specifico.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"101\" /><option startIndex=\"136\" endIndex=\"140\" /><option startIndex=\"146\" endIndex=\"171\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeDamage(amount) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (amount === \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Big hit!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Small hit&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ryu&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"player.takeDamage();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>if (amount === 10)</code>, seguito da <code>else</code> e infine <code>console.log(\"Small hit\");</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 149917,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ogni nuovo oggetto della classe <code>Player</code> che creiamo potrà usare il metodo <code>takeDamage()</code>.</p><p>Chiama di nuovo <code>takeDamage()</code>, ma questa volta passagli <code>10</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"233\" endIndex=\"235\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeDamage(amount) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (amount === \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Big hit!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Small hit&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ryu&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"player.takeDamage(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>10</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 149918,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale di questi è il modo corretto per iniziare a creare un metodo chiamato <code>update</code> all'interno di una classe?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>update()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>function update()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>update()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 149919,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La chiamata a un metodo di classe può restituire un valore?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Sì</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">No</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere Sì.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 149920,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale di queste affermazioni è vera riguardo a classi e metodi?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Gli oggetti creati da una classe hanno accesso ai suoi metodi</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Gli oggetti non hanno accesso ai metodi di una classe</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gli oggetti creati da una classe hanno accesso ai suoi metodi.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 149921,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi la versione corretta di un metodo che controlla la salute del giocatore.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"healthLevel:\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"81\" endIndex=\"94\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"PlayerHUD\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(playerName) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".playerName = playerName;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" healthLevel() {}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>healthLevel()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 149922,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scrivi il codice corretto per usare il metodo di classe di <code>PlayerHUD</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"134\" endIndex=\"137\" /><option startIndex=\"137\" endIndex=\"138\" /><option startIndex=\"138\" endIndex=\"149\" /><option startIndex=\"149\" endIndex=\"150\" /><option startIndex=\"150\" endIndex=\"151\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"PlayerHUD\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(playerName) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".playerName = playerName;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" healthLevel() {}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hud = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" PlayerHUD(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ryu&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"hud.healthLevel();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>hud</code>, seguito da <code>.</code> e poi <code>healthLevel</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 149923,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa la codifica del metodo che aumenta il punteggio del giocatore.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"75\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Score\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(points) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".points = points;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" increase() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".points = points + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>increase</code>, seguito da <code>(</code> e infine <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 149924,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Chiama il metodo <code>increase</code> con l'argomento <code>5</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"score.increase = 5;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"143\" endIndex=\"161\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Score\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(points) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".points = points;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" increase(amount) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".points += amount;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Score(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"score.increase(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(score);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>score.increase(5);</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
